WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.715
Mastery Starter 8.0.

00:00:02.715 --> 00:00:05.110
New to The DeFi Operating System?

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:06.170
Start here.

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.257
In about ten minutes, you'll go from

00:00:08.257 --> 00:00:09.950
zero to ready for this module.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.385
Individual positions don't make a portfolio.

00:00:14.385 --> 00:00:18.131
This module turns strategies into a system: buckets and

00:00:18.131 --> 00:00:21.742
caps, a risk register, a strategy library, a routine,

00:00:21.742 --> 00:00:26.090
honest performance measurement, and rules for your own behaviour.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.399
Bucket: a portion of capital with

00:00:29.399 --> 00:00:30.645
a job and a cap.

00:00:30.645 --> 00:00:34.340
Risk register: a scored list of risks and responses.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.850
Kill rule: a pre-written exit trigger.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.975
Benchmark: the simple alternative you must beat.

00:00:39.975 --> 00:00:43.755
TWR: return that ignores deposit timing.

00:00:45.055 --> 00:00:46.790
Modules 0–7.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.494
Write your current holdings into four buckets (reserve,

00:00:51.494 --> 00:00:55.020
core, productive, speculative) with a percentage for each.

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.110
Beginner: Has buckets, caps and a journal.

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:03.366
Practitioner: Keeps a scored risk register, uses the

00:01:03.366 --> 00:01:07.360
strategy library, measures TWR vs a benchmark.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.741
Master: Runs a disciplined routine with

00:01:09.741 --> 00:01:12.480
written rules for behaviour, reviewed monthly.

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:16.799
You've mastered this module when you have a written

00:01:16.799 --> 00:01:20.282
portfolio plan and a quarter of honest, benchmarked results.

00:01:21.582 --> 00:01:24.097
Do the checklist now, before you move on.

00:01:24.097 --> 00:01:28.162
Next up, Lesson 8.1: DeFi portfolio construction.
